{"repository_name":"time_in_words","body":"# time_in_words\n\nAll code stolen from [lucky framework time_helpers](https://github.com/luckyframework/lucky/blob/main/src/lucky/page_helpers/time_helpers.cr), but added the Chinese support.\n\nOnly EN and ZH_CN supported for now, PR is welcome.\n\nThe locale name will follow name in [this](https://github.com/crystal-i18n/i18n/blob/a0d6276114a31f233cfec4ac928a01051ab01aa2/src/i18n/pluralization.cr#L33-L178) file.\n\n## Documentation\n\n[API documentation](https://crystal-china.github.io/time_in_words/)\n\n## Installation\n\n1. Add the dependency to your `shard.yml`:\n\n   ```yaml\n   dependencies:\n     time_in_words:\n       github: crystal_china/time_in_words\n   ```\n\n2. Run `shards install`\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\nThe `from` method's `past_time:` keyword argument has been renamed to `time:`\nbecause it supports both past and future times. Update existing calls:\n\n```crystal\n# Before\nTimeHelper.from(past_time: posted_at)\n\n# After\nTimeHelper.from(time: posted_at)\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```crystal\nrequire \"time_in_words\"\n\nalias TimeHelper = TimeInWords::Helpers(TimeInWords::I18n::ZH_CN)\n\nTimeHelper.from(time: Time.local - 13.months) # => \"大约一年前\"\n\nfrom_time = Time.local\nTimeHelper.distance(from: from_time, to: from_time + 50.minutes) # => \"大约一个小时\"\nTimeHelper.distance(from: from_time, to: from_time + 35.minutes) # => \"35 分钟\"\n\nspan = 4.minutes\nTimeHelper.distance(span: span) # => \"四分钟\"\n\nTimeHelper.distance(span: Time::Span.zero) # => \"零秒\"\nTimeHelper.from(time: Time.utc)            # => \"刚刚\"\n```\n\nCheck the [time_in_words_en_spec.cr](spec/time_in_words_en_spec.cr) for usage about English time words.\n\nIn both languages, `distance` returns only the duration, regardless of the order\nof its dates or the sign of its span. `from` adds `ago` / `前` for past times and\n`in` / `后` for future times; the Chinese result for the current moment is `刚刚`.\n\nBoth methods describe elapsed duration rather than calendar date differences.\nDay-level descriptions use Rails-style minute rounding: 60 hours becomes\n3 days, regardless of the input time zones. Month descriptions use complete\nelapsed days and start at 30 days. English uses \"about 2 months\" from 45 days\nup to, but not including, 60 days. Chinese keeps \"大约一个半月\" from 38 days\nup to, but not including, 52 days.\nSecond and year descriptions keep their existing rules.\n\n```crystal\nnow = Time.utc(2026, 10, 20, 14)\nposted_at = now - 60.hours\n\nTimeHelper.from(time: posted_at, now: now) # => \"三天前\"\n```\n\n`now` is optional and defaults to the current time. Pass it when you need a fixed\nreference time, such as in tests or when rendering several timestamps together.\n\nYear descriptions follow Rails' approximate / over / almost thresholds. Date\npairs account for leap days; a bare `Time::Span` uses fixed 365-day years because\nit has no calendar dates.\n\n```crystal\nalias EnglishTimeHelper = TimeInWords::Helpers(TimeInWords::I18n::EN)\n\nEnglishTimeHelper.from(time: Time.utc - 2.hours) # => \"about 2 hours ago\"\nEnglishTimeHelper.distance(span: 2.hours)       # => \"about 2 hours\"\n```\n\n## Development\n\nTODO: Write development instructions here\n\n## Contributing\n\n1. Fork it (<https://github.com/zw963/time_in_words/fork>)\n2. Run `make` to ensure spec passed.\n2. Create your feature branch (`git checkout -b my-new-feature`)\n3. Commit your changes (`git commit -am 'Add some feature'`)\n4. Run `make` again to ensure spec passed.\n4. Push to the branch (`git push origin my-new-feature`)\n5. Create a new Pull Request\n\n## Contributors\n\n- [Billy.Zheng](https://github.com/zw963) - creator and maintainer\n","program":{"html_id":"time_in_words/toplevel","path":"toplevel.html","kind":"module","full_name":"Top Level Namespace","name":"Top Level Namespace","abstract":false,"locations":[],"repository_name":"time_in_words","program":true,"enum":false,"alias":false,"const":false,"types":[{"html_id":"time_in_words/TimeInWords","path":"TimeInWords.html","kind":"module","full_name":"TimeInWords","name":"TimeInWords","abstract":false,"locations":[{"filename":"src/i18n/en.cr","line_number":1,"url":"https://github.com/crystal-china/time_in_words/blob/1c2811cbd05203145dfcf196502ee3dd398bd407/src/i18n/en.cr#L1"},{"filename":"src/i18n/zh_cn.cr","line_number":1,"url":"https://github.com/crystal-china/time_in_words/blob/1c2811cbd05203145dfcf196502ee3dd398bd407/src/i18n/zh_cn.cr#L1"},{"filename":"src/time_in_words.cr","line_number":3,"url":"https://github.com/crystal-china/time_in_words/blob/1c2811cbd05203145dfcf196502ee3dd398bd407/src/time_in_words.cr#L3"}],"repository_name":"time_in_words","program":false,"enum":false,"alias":false,"const":false,"constants":[{"id":"VERSION","name":"VERSION","value":"{{ \n  (((`shards version \\\"/home/runner/work/time_in_words/time_in_words/src\\\"`).chomp.stringify + \" (rev \") + (`git rev-parse --short HEAD`).chomp.stringify) + \")\"\n }}"}],"types":[{"html_id":"time_in_words/TimeInWords/Helpers","path":"TimeInWords/Helpers.html","kind":"module","full_name":"TimeInWords::Helpers(T)","name":"Helpers","abstract":false,"locations":[{"filename":"src/time_in_words.cr","line_number":11,"url":"https://github.com/crystal-china/time_in_words/blob/1c2811cbd05203145dfcf196502ee3dd398bd407/src/time_in_words.cr#L11"}],"repository_name":"time_in_words","program":false,"enum":false,"alias":false,"const":false,"extended_modules":[{"html_id":"time_in_words/TimeInWords/Helpers","kind":"module","full_name":"TimeInWords::Helpers","name":"Helpers"}],"namespace":{"html_id":"time_in_words/TimeInWords","kind":"module","full_name":"TimeInWords","name":"TimeInWords"},"instance_methods":[{"html_id":"distance(*,from:Time,to:Time):String-instance-method","name":"distance","doc":"Returns a `String` with approximate distance in time between `from` and `to`.\n\n```\ndistance_of_time_in_words(Time.utc(2019, 8, 14, 10, 0, 0), Time.utc(2019, 8, 14, 10, 0, 5))\n# => \"5 seconds\"\ndistance_of_time_in_words(Time.utc(2019, 8, 14, 10, 0), Time.utc(2019, 8, 14, 10, 25))\n# => \"25 minutes\"\ndistance_of_time_in_words(Time.utc(2019, 8, 14, 10), Time.utc(2019, 8, 14, 11))\n# => \"about an hour\"\ndistance_of_time_in_words(Time.utc(2019, 8, 14), Time.utc(2019, 8, 16))\n# => \"2 days\"\ndistance_of_time_in_words(Time.utc(2019, 8, 14), Time.utc(2019, 10, 4))\n# => \"about 2 months\"\ndistance_of_time_in_words(Time.utc(2019, 8, 14), Time.utc(2061, 10, 4))\n# => \"about 42 years\"\n```","summary":"<p>Returns a <code>String</code> with approximate distance in time between <code><a href=\"../TimeInWords/Helpers.html#from%28%2A%2Ctime%3ATime%2Cnow%3ATime%3DTime.utc%29%3AString-instance-method\">#from</a></code> and <code>to</code>.</p>","abstract":false,"args":[{"name":"","external_name":"","restriction":""},{"name":"from","external_name":"from","restriction":"Time"},{"name":"to","external_name":"to","restriction":"Time"}],"args_string":"(*, from : Time, to : Time) : String","args_html":"(*, from : Time, to : Time) : String","location":{"filename":"src/time_in_words.cr","line_number":30,"url":"https://github.com/crystal-china/time_in_words/blob/1c2811cbd05203145dfcf196502ee3dd398bd407/src/time_in_words.cr#L30"},"def":{"name":"distance","args":[{"name":"","external_name":"","restriction":""},{"name":"from","external_name":"from","restriction":"Time"},{"name":"to","external_name":"to","restriction":"Time"}],"splat_index":0,"return_type":"String","visibility":"Public","body":"distance_of_time_in_words(from: from, to: to)"},"external_var":false},{"html_id":"distance(*,span:Time::Span):String-instance-method","name":"distance","doc":"Returns a `String` with approximate distance in time between `from` and `to`.\n\n```\ndistance_of_time_in_words(Time.utc(2019, 8, 14, 10, 0, 0), Time.utc(2019, 8, 14, 10, 0, 5))\n# => \"5 seconds\"\ndistance_of_time_in_words(Time.utc(2019, 8, 14, 10, 0), Time.utc(2019, 8, 14, 10, 25))\n# => \"25 minutes\"\ndistance_of_time_in_words(Time.utc(2019, 8, 14, 10), Time.utc(2019, 8, 14, 11))\n# => \"about an hour\"\ndistance_of_time_in_words(Time.utc(2019, 8, 14), Time.utc(2019, 8, 16))\n# => \"2 days\"\ndistance_of_time_in_words(Time.utc(2019, 8, 14), Time.utc(2019, 10, 4))\n# => \"about 2 months\"\ndistance_of_time_in_words(Time.utc(2019, 8, 14), Time.utc(2061, 10, 4))\n# => \"about 42 years\"\n```","summary":"<p>Returns a <code>String</code> with approximate distance in time between <code><a href=\"../TimeInWords/Helpers.html#from%28%2A%2Ctime%3ATime%2Cnow%3ATime%3DTime.utc%29%3AString-instance-method\">#from</a></code> and <code>to</code>.</p>","abstract":false,"args":[{"name":"","external_name":"","restriction":""},{"name":"span","external_name":"span","restriction":"Time::Span"}],"args_string":"(*, span : Time::Span) : String","args_html":"(*, span : Time::Span) : String","location":{"filename":"src/time_in_words.cr","line_number":35,"url":"https://github.com/crystal-china/time_in_words/blob/1c2811cbd05203145dfcf196502ee3dd398bd407/src/time_in_words.cr#L35"},"def":{"name":"distance","args":[{"name":"","external_name":"","restriction":""},{"name":"span","external_name":"span","restriction":"Time::Span"}],"splat_index":0,"return_type":"String","visibility":"Public","body":"distance_of_time_in_words(span: span)"},"external_var":false},{"html_id":"from(*,time:Time,now:Time=Time.utc):String-instance-method","name":"from","doc":"Returns the approximate relative time based on elapsed duration.","summary":"<p>Returns the approximate relative time based on elapsed duration.</p>","abstract":false,"args":[{"name":"","external_name":"","restriction":""},{"name":"time","external_name":"time","restriction":"Time"},{"name":"now","default_value":"Time.utc","external_name":"now","restriction":"Time"}],"args_string":"(*, time : Time, now : Time = Time.utc) : String","args_html":"(*, time : Time, now : Time = <span class=\"t\">Time</span>.utc) : String","location":{"filename":"src/time_in_words.cr","line_